---
description: Creating a new record opens its own form page, not a modal or an inline form.
alwaysApply: true
---

# New item form page

A New or Add control that creates a record (a promo code, a product, a SKU, and the same kind of thing) opens a form page. It does not open a modal, and it does not drop the fields onto the list.

- The list keeps a button. The button links to a route such as `/admin/promo/new` or `/admin/products/[productId]/skus/new`.
- That route renders the fields and a save action. After a successful save, return to the list.
- Editing an existing promo code uses its own page too (`/admin/promo/[promoCodeId]`).
